16166                       
16167                      basic commands:                         
16168                          '*' command same as DATA (ignore the current basic statement, up to next ':' or end of line)
16169                          CARD/PUNCH commands same as REM (ignore the current basic line)
16170                          USER() func -> calls func at addr given by [$67,$68]
16171                   
16172                   fixes to make LOAD/SAVE and TLOAD/TSAVE to work again
16173                   
16174                      remove ^R ($12) PTP ON at beginning of each listed line
16175                      convert JSR PRTCH in TST PRTCH to not out the char 
16176                                                 org     $0310 
16177                                                 fcb     $7D
16178                   
16179                      remove ^R ($14) PTP OFF at beginning of each listed line
16180                      convert JMP PRTCH in RTS to just return 
16181                                                 org     $033A
16182                                                 fcb     $39
16183                   
16184                      the following path is needed in order to read from PTR only 
16185                      when TAPPEND or TLOAD commands are used
16186                      remove ^Q ($11) PTR ON issued ':' prompt
16187                      convert JSR PRTCH in TST PRTCH to not out the char 
16188                                                 org     $0206
16189                                                 fcb     $7D
16190                   
16191                      the following is needed to accept basic programs without requiring each
16192                      line to start by char $02 just before line number digits
16193                                                 org     $0B8E
16194                                                 fcb     $03
